{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121984","id":4179866024,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc75I7Go","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121984","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121984.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121984.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121984","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121984/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121984/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121984/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/e4a1d9fbb52ea85442e8d9360be833178c7858fb","number":121984,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add audio range debug visualization for AudioStreamPlayer2D V2","user":{"login":"Thiago-Weiss","id":137117035,"node_id":"U_kgDOCCw9aw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137117035?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss","html_url":"https://github.com/Thiago-Weiss","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"# What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nCurrently, there is no way to visualize the audible range of an `AudioStreamPlayer2D` in the editor. The node provides configuration properties such as `max_distance` and `attenuation`, but these properties are only represented as numeric values, and there is no easy way to visualize what they actually represent in the game.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# Solution\r\n\r\nThis PR adds an editor plugin for `AudioStreamPlayer2D` that provides an interactive handle for editing the `max_distance` property directly in the 2D editor, similar to how the radius of a `CircleShape2D` can be adjusted through a `CollisionShape2D`, the gizmo also draw the audible range of the selected `AudioStreamPlayer2D`, making it much easier to configure positional audio directly in the editor, also this PR introduces new settings under **Project Settings > Debug > Shapes**, allowing users to configure how the audible range is visualized.\r\n\r\n### Important\r\n\r\nThis PR only visualizes the currently selected `AudioStreamPlayer2D` node in the editor. It is an alternative implementation to another PR that displays the audible range for all `AudioStreamPlayer2D` nodes simultaneously and also supports in-game visualization through a debug option. That alternative implementation can be found [here](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121471).\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# Demonstration\r\n\r\n[The video showing the feature](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/69b55078-c80a-4cfc-8025-b9a4d550760b)\r\n\r\n## Help\r\n\r\nThis PR is based on the proposal discussed here: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/15229\r\n\r\nIf you like the idea, please consider reacting to the proposal with a 👍.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZ